          "signals": {},
          "charges": 1,
          "lore": "<p>A slushy-blue vial. When you drink it, you are suffused with a supernatural calm for 1 hour:</p><ul><li>Resistance to <b>thermal (cold)</b> damage.</li><li>Reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being <b>Shaken</b>.</li><li><b>Radical Cool (1/Duration).</b> When you take fire or thermal (cold) damage, use your reaction to reduce it by <b>2d6</b>.</li></ul><p>The effect ends early if you are Staggered.</p><p><i>Engine note: the immediate sip restores stress and softens the channel — extended duration buffs are GM-tracked.</i></p>",
